M is a maximum number over all the configured cell set(s) S in a PUCCH group of the sum of [EQUATION] (if nrofHARQ-BundlingGroups is not provided for a serving cell c) or [EQUATION] (if nrofHARQ-BundlingGroups is provided for the serving cell c) across serving cells of a respective cell set S that can be co-scheduled by a DCI format 1_3;
